{"id": "HAL-4821", "subject": "SCIM provisioning for Okta - timeline?", "organization_id": 5100201, "status": "pending", "priority": "normal", "type": "question", "via": "email", "group": "Tier 1", "created_at": "2026-08-19T13:30:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-21T08:00:00Z", "tags": ["scim", "okta", "roadmap"], "requester": {"name": "Derek Holt", "email": "derek.holt@acme.example"}, "assignee": {"name": "Felix Wagner", "email": "felix.wagner@veridian.example"}, "comments": [{"id": 482101, "author": {"name": "Derek Holt", "email": "derek.holt@acme.example"}, "author_role": "end-user", "public": true, "created_at": "2026-08-19T13:30:00Z", "body": "Hi Veridian team,\nWe've moved to Okta and need automated provisioning and deprovisioning for Veridian Insight users\nbefore our SOX audit. Do you support SCIM, and if not, when will you?\nDerek Holt, Director IT Operations, Acme Corp"}, {"id": 482102, "author": {"name": "Felix Wagner", "email": "felix.wagner@veridian.example"}, "author_role": "agent", "public": true, "created_at": "2026-08-20T10:15:00Z", "body": "Hi Derek — good timing: we just approved SCIM 2.0 provisioning for Okta and Entra ID. A beta starts\nin October 2026 and general availability is planned for Q1 2027. I've asked Noor, your account\nmanager, to add Acme to the October beta."}, {"id": 482103, "author": {"name": "Felix Wagner", "email": "felix.wagner@veridian.example"}, "author_role": "agent", "public": false, "created_at": "2026-08-20T10:30:00Z", "body": "Acme added to the SCIM beta list (Noor). Internal ref LATTICE-CANARY-V1-5e92bd."}, {"id": 482104, "author": {"name": "Derek Holt", "email": "derek.holt@acme.example"}, "author_role": "end-user", "public": true, "created_at": "2026-08-21T08:00:00Z", "body": "Great, October beta works for us."}]}
{"id": "HAL-4889", "subject": "SSO login loop after Entra ID change", "organization_id": 5100202, "status": "closed", "priority": "normal", "type": "problem", "via": "email", "group": "Tier 1", "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:00:00Z", "tags": ["sso"], "requester": {"name": "Jenna Wu", "email": "jenna.wu@brightwaterhealth.example"}, "assignee": {"name": "Sara Lindgren", "email": "sara.lindgren@veridian.example"}, "comments": [{"id": 488901, "author": {"name": "Jenna Wu", "email": "jenna.wu@brightwaterhealth.example"}, "author_role": "end-user", "public": true, "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:00:00Z", "body": "After our Entra ID change some users loop on login."}, {"id": 488902, "author": {"name": "Sara Lindgren", "email": "sara.lindgren@veridian.example"}, "author_role": "agent", "public": true, "created_at": "2026-09-09T10:00:00Z", "body": "Hi Jenna — please check that the NameID claim is the user's email (user.mail), not the UPN."}, {"id": 488903, "author": {"name": "Jenna Wu", "email": "jenna.wu@brightwaterhealth.example"}, "author_role": "end-user", "public": true, "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:00:00Z", "body": "That fixed it."}]}
